2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c4c54a7a2d1da4d242d5f873110f8167 3x"}, "body": "Excuse my request.\n\nI would like to request Shuo Sango-chan from \ud83c\udf08vtuber.\n\nI'd like to have an adventure, enjoying the summer. ...Dream?\n\u25cfExample of development\nIn the forest, they are looking for a treasure. Pointing in the direction of the treasure.\nCaptain Shuo Sango, wearing a camp hat, points in the direction of the treasure.\n\"Minnano mono, let's go! He is enthusiastic.\n\nCaptain Shuoh, who had found the treasure, shared his joy with his team members, \"I'm going to make a fortune! Now our future is secure.\n\u301cNow our future is secure. He was dreaming. The End\n\nHope to see you again!\nThe story does not have to have an ending, just the part about finding the treasure is fine.\nThe members of the team should be deformed forest animals (squirrels, rabbits, bears, etc.).\nOr, from the live archive of Sango Shuo, Kirby, Stuffy, Pokemon, etc....", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@yagisobaco/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1514729, "client_id": 1899865, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1ef3b98e/uploads/origins/c3ad684d-bbe0-4d45-9dbe-2c143a881c07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87e8d9c80f2ffc70b1a6674d1ca9ee8d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1ef3b98e/uploads/origins/c3ad684d-bbe0-4d45-9dbe-2c143a881c07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=87e8d9c80f2ffc70b1a6674d1ca9ee8d, https://si.imgix.net/1ef3b98e/uploads/origins/c3ad684d-bbe0-4d45-9dbe-2c143a881c07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=191c314d87f5e96e7fc19bd3a99bd323 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1ef3b98e/uploads/origins/c3ad684d-bbe0-4d45-9dbe-2c143a881c07?bg=%23fff&au